{
  "name": "Grade a Base agent job from its on-chain record (Jev judge)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "name": "Start",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        420
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "c",
              "name": "chain",
              "value": "8453",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "j",
              "name": "job",
              "value": "bitagent:8453:7287",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Which job",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        220,
        420
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "=https://coord.taifoon.dev/v1/judge/evidence/{{ $json.chain }}/{{ encodeURIComponent($json.job) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Read its record (public)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        440,
        420
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const e = $input.first().json;\nconst fact = (re) => (e.facts.find(([k]) => re.test(k)) || [])[1] || '';\nconst delivered = !!fact(/what was delivered/i) && !/nothing|not delivered/i.test(fact(/what was delivered/i));\nconst job = $('Which job').first().json;\nreturn [{ json: { state: e.state, ref: job.job, chainId: Number(job.chain), jobId: (job.job.match(/(\\d+)$/) || [])[1] || job.job,\n  facts: { delivered, checks: { funded: /funded/i.test(fact(/^funded$/i)) || !!fact(/^funded$/i), submitted: !!fact(/^submitted$/i) } } } }];"
      },
      "name": "Facts from the chain",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        660,
        420
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "ask",
        "connection": "direct",
        "model": "jev-1.13.0",
        "questions": {},
        "questionsJson": "[]",
        "routing": "{}",
        "replyLanguage": "off",
        "failClosed": true,
        "state": "={{ $json.state }}",
        "jev": {
          "rubric": true,
          "subject": "={{ $json.ref }}",
          "chainId": "={{ $json.chainId }}",
          "factsJson": "={{ JSON.stringify($json.facts) }}",
          "evaluator": "bitagent-erc8183",
          "jobId": "={{ $json.jobId }}"
        }
      },
      "name": "TypeSafe",
      "type": "@taifoon/n8n-nodes-typesafe.taifoonTypeSafe",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        900,
        420
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "taifoonTypeSafeApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "TypeSafe API (your key from console.typesafe.ai)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "name": "Complete: sign the evaluator call",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1140,
        240
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "name": "Reject: sign the evaluator call",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1140,
        420
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "name": "Needs review: nothing ends, appeal",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1140,
        600
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Grade a real agent job on Base\n\n**Read its record** fetches the public evidence for an ERC-8183 job (no key): the task, price, parties and every event.\n\nTypeSafe (Jev) grades it on **your own key**. The output carries the unsigned `complete` / `reject` call for the job's evaluator seat: sign it with that wallet. Nothing is signed or sent here.\n\nChange **Which job** to any Base job, e.g. `8453:81100` for Virtuals ACP (set Evaluator Call to match).",
        "width": 560,
        "height": 320
      },
      "name": "How it works",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        200,
        20
      ]
    }
  ],
